    "summary_one_sentence": "When a devastating Category 5 hurricane inundates a coastal town, surviving residents must fight for their lives against both deadly flooding and a frenzy of hungry sharks washed ashore.",
    "summary_short": "A catastrophic Category 5 hurricane strikes a coastal community, unleashing a massive storm surge that destroys homes and traps survivors in rising floodwaters. As if the extreme natural disaster were not enough, the incoming waters carry a school of ferocious, hungry sharks directly into the flooded town. Cut off from rescue, a group of desperate townspeople must navigate treacherous waters and internal panic to stay alive. They must outsmart nature's most efficient predators in an environment turned entirely against them.",
    "summary_long": "The coastal town prepares for a brutal storm, but few anticipate the sheer destructive force of a Category 5 hurricane making direct landfall. As the tempest roars ashore, a massive storm surge completely engulfs the low-lying neighborhoods, submerging streets and trapping residents inside decaying structures. Amidst the howling winds and collapsing roofs, a terrifying new threat emerges from the murky surge waters: a deadly collection of displaced, aggressive sharks searching for food. With power lines down, communication severed, and emergency services unable to navigate the devastation, the scattered survivors are forced to forge uneasy alliances. They must navigate perilous, debris-strewn floodwaters while constantly scanning the dark surface for dorsal fins. Every movement through the water risks attracting the swift underwater hunters, turning simple tasks like crossing a street into life-or-death gauntlets. As night falls and the floodwaters continue to rise, the survivors draw upon sheer desperation and makeshift weapons to defend their temporary refuges. Resourcefulness becomes their only shield against the relentless double threat of extreme weather and marine predators. Ultimately, the remaining group must pull off a daring high-stakes escape plan to reach higher ground before the surge completely swallows their town and the pack of predators closes in for good.",
    "synopsis": "Thrash is a high-octane blend of survival horror, disaster drama, and creature feature suspense set during a historic weather event. The narrative follows a small group of resilient coastal residents whose lives are thrown into complete chaos when a Category 5 hurricane batters their homeland. What begins as a tense struggle to endure ferocious winds and rapidly rising storm surges takes a nightmare turn as apex predators are swept directly into the flooded residential streets. Cut off from help and surrounded by deep, murky waters, the characters are forced to overcome personal conflicts and physical barriers to outwit an invisible threat hunting beneath the surface. Packed with heart-pounding suspense and emotional drama, the film explores the bounds of human endurance when confronted by the combined wrath of nature and marine horrors.",
